{"name":"Needed Escape","hex":"#b1d6de","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"needed","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Necessary; being required."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["simple past and past participle of need"]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/needed"},{"term":"escape","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To get free; to free oneself.","To break out of confinement."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["The act of leaving a dangerous or unpleasant situation.","Leakage or outflow, as of steam or a liquid, or an electric current through defective insulation."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/escape"}],"entries":[{"title":"Need","blocks":[{"text":"A need is a requirement for survival or optimal functioning at a point of time and in a given context. Needs are distinguished from wants. In the case of a need, a deficiency causes a clear adverse outcome: a dysfunction or death. In other words, a need is something required for a safe, stable and healthy life while a want is a desire, wish or aspiration. When needs or wants are backed by purchasing power, they have the potential to become economic demands."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Need","wikidata":"Q190258"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/ff/Maslow%27s_Hierarchy_of_Needs.png/500px-Maslow%27s_Hierarchy_of_Needs.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/ff/Maslow%27s_Hierarchy_of_Needs.png/500px-Maslow%27s_Hierarchy_of_Needs.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Maslow's Hierarchy of Needs","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AMaslow's_Hierarchy_of_Needs.png"}],"sounds":{"needed":[{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/cd/En-us-needed.ogg?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/cd/En-us-needed.ogg/En-us-needed.ogg.mp3"}],"escape":[{"type":"audio/wav","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/44/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Naomi_Persephone_Amethyst_%28NaomiAmethyst%29-escape.wav?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/4/44/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Naomi_Persephone_Amethyst_%28NaomiAmethyst%29-escape.wav/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Naomi_Persephone_Amethyst_%28NaomiAmethyst%29-escape.wav.mp3"},{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/4/44/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Naomi_Persephone_Amethyst_%28NaomiAmethyst%29-escape.wav/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Naomi_Persephone_Amethyst_%28NaomiAmethyst%29-escape.wav.ogg"},{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/39/En-us-escape.ogg?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/3/39/En-us-escape.ogg/En-us-escape.ogg.mp3"}]}}}